OL,3,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,4,APoland mass shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British citizen is among six people
OL,7,Fkilled in the Krakow shooting, the head
OL,8,Fof Poland's police force says
OL,10,FMarek Boron says three Polish citizens
OL,11,Fwere also killed, with two yet to be
OL,12,Fidentified - 16 people were injured in
OL,13,Fthe attack, including the suspect, two
OL,14,Fpolice officers and five foreign
OL,15,Fnationals
OL,17,FSpeaking at the same press conference,
OL,18,FPolish Prime Minister Donald Tusk says
OL,19,Fthree bodies were found at the
OL,20,Fsuspect's home, which authorities
OL,21,Fcontinue to search
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
