OL,3,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,4,APoland mass shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe've also heard from Poland's interior
OL,7,Fminister this evening - he said the
OL,8,Fsuspect - a 25-year-old Polish citizen
OL,9,F- is believed to have been inspired by
OL,10,F"far-right ideologies"
OL,12,FVideo shows gunshots ringing out in the
OL,13,Fsquare; images show emergency services
OL,14,Fat the scene
